s://github.com/ymahlau","id":59509701,"login":"ymahlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTA5NzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-10-03T06:46:07Z","event":"subscribed","id":14499468623,"node_id":"SE_lADOCTkjjc6S8Nn1zwAAAANgPFVP","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/14499468623"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59509701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ymahlau","id":59509701,"login":"ymahlau","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTA5NzAx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"NONE","body":"Hi @rajasekharporeddy, \r\n\r\nthanks for your help! The issue number 2 is indeed fixed in the new JAX version. \r\n\r\nHowever, the issue number 1 still persists. It is not entirely clear to me which JAX calls are lowered to an all-gather operation and which are not. It seems that dynamic indices are not lowered to an all-gather operation, while static integer indices are:\r\n\r\n```\r\nres = x.at[s].set(updates)              # all-gather\r\nres = x.at[0:3].set(updates)            # all-gather\r\nres = x.at[indices[:, 0]].set(updates)  # works\r\nres = jax.lax.scatter(                  # works\r\n    x,\r\n    indices,\r\n    updates,\r\n    jax.lax.ScatterDimensionNumbers(\r\n        update_window_dims=(1,),\r\n        inserted_window_dims=(0,),\r\n        scatter_dims_to_operand_dims=(0,)\r\n    )\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nDo you have any insights on how to avoid all-gather operations? My arrays are so large that they do not fit on a single GPU. As a result, all-gather operations kill the whole program. Converting the static slices into indices is a workaround, but with a lot of indices, the index array also quickly becomes too large for a single GPU.\r\n\r\nMany thanks\r\nYannik","created_at":"2024-10-11T10:14:28Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/23052#issuecomment-2407092985","id":2407092985,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/23052","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6PeVL5","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2407092985/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-10-11T10:14:28Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2407092985","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59509701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ymahlau/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ymahlau","id":5950